# The extra catalog: opt-in per-user apps -- what used to be
# preinstalled on every platform, plus the general-desktop half of the old
# full-desktop catalog (GNOME Circle and community apps).
#   ujust install-flatpaks extra
# installs them, `ujust remove-flatpaks extra` takes them away.
# Validated against Flathub by .github/workflows/validate-flatpaks.yml.
